OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless shelter expansion looks
OL,4,Aset to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to renovate and expand a homeless
OL,7,Fshelter look set to be waved through in
OL,8,FSurrey.
OL,10,FProposals by Guildford Borough Council
OL,11,Ffor The Number 5 Hub on the town's York
OL,12,FRoad include converting a neighbouring
OL,13,Fproperty - which currently hosts three
OL,14,Fone-bedroom flats - into additional
OL,15,Ftemporary accommodation for those in
OL,16,Fneed.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
