OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless shelter expansion looks
OL,4,Aset to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans, which are due to be brought
OL,7,Fbefore the council's planning committee
OL,8,Fon Wednesday, come as Prime Minister
OL,9,FAndy Burnham pledged to get rough
OL,10,Fsleepers in England off the streets
OL,11,Fbefore Christmas.
OL,13,FA planning officers' report called it
OL,14,Fan offer of "temporary safe
OL,15,Faccommodation to those at risk of
OL,16,Fsleeping rough while a more permanent
OL,17,Fsolution is found".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
